{"id": "eda5fb38-9f66-43bb-9515-4ac8c8797636", "role": "assistant", "block_type": "thinking", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm calculating the cost impact: since the deploy workflow applies template defaults without overrides, bumping DbInstanceClass from db.r6g.large to db.r6g.xlarge will double the Multi-AZ hourly rate from 0.500 to 1.000 USD/hr upon deployment.

Storage costs stay fixed at 200 GB GP3 Multi-AZ ($0.250/GB-Mo, $50/month), so using 730 hours/month, the instance cost rises from $365 to $730, pushing total monthly cost from $415 to $780 — a $365/month increase. The CostCenter tag and the unused-box line item don't affect this calculation.

"}]}
